              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The general rides a horse and has a hand weapon and light armour. Army General. May have heavy armour (+1), composite bow (+4), thrusting spear (+3) and barding (+4).</characteristic>
